import OddPerfect.EqualExponentChain

/-!
# Equal exponent chains: instances for larger primes

Kernel checked certificates, for the checker `OddPerfect.EqChain.checkAll` of
`OddPerfect.EqualExponentChain`, showing that the exponents other than the special prime of an
odd perfect number cannot all equal `l - 1` for `l = 59`. The certificates were found by an
untrusted search and are checked by `decide +kernel`. Restricted family result; no published
source was checked; novelty not verified.
-/

namespace OddPerfect.EqChain

